{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/GettingStarted"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}]},{"anchor":"Prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Embed the Certificate","anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Fetch a Session Token","level":2,"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to 